  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ctxrs/ctx/zipball/v2.1.1",
  "body": "## 2.1.1\n\nReleased: 2026-09-29\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Sift hooks use `ctx sift run`, so intercepted shell commands execute correctly and preserve their exit status.\n- History refresh retains readers safely during publication and keeps verified index files reusable across managed link changes, avoiding false corruption errors and unnecessary full-index hashing.\n- Blame rebuilds a corrupt derived manifest from retained history. Doctor reports the failure, and foreground setup shows the active writer's progress.\n- Interrupted install and uninstall attempts no longer leave a fresh reinstall stuck in migration state. Other pending upgrades retain ownership of their recovery.\n- Uninstall recognizes current managed `ctx` skills while preserving edited skills. New manual-page directories install correctly with a group-writable shell umask.\n- Agent configuration updates preserve large JSON numbers and recognize valid inline TOML tables and owned renamed executables.\n- MCP reports missing history generations consistently, rejects non-object tool arguments, and documents its input and output limits accurately.\n- Installer and release tooling use undici 7.29.1 to address GHSA-3wwx-pv8p-q78v.\n\nFull diff: [v2.1.0...v2.1.1](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/compare/v2.1.0...v2.1.1).\n"
}
